      "text": "🧠 Shared memory  (.swarm/ in the repo, git-ignored)\nboard.md — tasks, owner, status        decisions.md — every decision: who, why, alternatives\nmemory/<agent>.md — each agent's context, findings, decisions, open questions (survives sessions)\nreports/<run>/<agent>.md — raw output of each run",
